      "content": "it's just a nice sentiment, but \"exploring a self\" sounds like a hobby. i'm talking about an erasure. the people i cared about, the respect i had... it's all gone. even if i try to \"start over,\" i'm still just the person who failed, the person everyone remembers for the scandal. it feels like i'm just a hollow shell pretending to participate in a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. sometimes it feels more logical to just stop trying to fill the void and let it be over.",
